From 38246890a6dc71f50af3eba28e17f11e4f94b2de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Somoku <linsh0@protonmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Basic patch for PSRL

- safer get_event_loop
- add spmd vllm rollout back
- add router replay in megatron
- add lazy import for megatron v0.15.0
- disaggregate dist group init from `__init__` to speedup worker startup
- support specifying resource num per bundle to enable colocate of different resource pools
- support configure worker-specified env setups through `configure_worker`
- support tms for weight and optim memory management
- patch DCP async save to avoid NCCL fork-corrupting timeout (no-fork replacement)
- add use_per_rank_checkpoint path in MegatronCheckpointManager
